Z||000000||cscougar||07-21-2000||04:42 PM||||Can anyone tell me the location of the sending unit for the temperature guage on the v-6?  ||||reg||1
Z||000001||BN Boomer||07-21-2000||04:48 PM||||The sending unit for the temperature guage is on the left corner of the rear cylinder head, near the ignition coil. The one for the ECM is off to the side of and behind the thermostat housing.||||reg||1
